'''Homura Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 295
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Homura Cat
|name2 = Magical Girl Homura Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Magical Girl Homura Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Due to Homura's short range, lack of spammability, low Freeze chance, Single Attack, and low stats, Homura is unable to hold even a candle to [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]]. Provided you have Bombercat, you will never use her, and instead use her for obtaining a higher [[User Rank]]. Even if you have not gained Bombercat, Homura's long recharge time, low stun chance, and weak stats makes it so that it is probably best to set her aside and progress further in the game to get Bombercat.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

